6
00:00:22.273 --> 00:00:26.727
boundary, reconcile uncertain effects,
recover to explicit objectives,

7
00:00:26.727 --> 00:00:31.182
communicate responsibly, and convert
evidence into owned improvements. Keep one

8
00:00:31.182 --> 00:00:35.636
