policy decision, infrastructure,
dependency state, and outcome before

17
00:01:09.769 --> 00:01:13.923
calling every symptom a model failure. Set
severity from actual

18
00:01:13.923 --> 00:01:18.077
and credible potential impact to people,
data, authorization, external actions,

19
00:01:18.077 --> 00:01:22.231
service, money, and legal or safety
duties. Name an incident

20
00:01:22.231 --> 00:01:26.385
lead, evidence owner, technical
