110
00:08:57.000 --> 00:09:01.167
telemetry, alerts, cost, reconciled
external effects, and user-visible

111
00:09:01.167 --> 00:09:05.333
postconditions. Restore traffic in bounded
stages and stop if recurrence

112
00:09:05.333 --> 00:09:09.500
appears. A green health endpoint proves
only that one process

113
00:09:09.500 --> 00:09:13.667
